4: 	(works while registration is closed; priority = today), then the same
5: 	Fast-track in one Phoenix transaction. A refused email (already on the
6: 	Waitlist, a Member's, or with a pending Invitation) shows under Email.
7: -->
8: <script lang="ts">
9: import { CalendarDate, type DateValue } from "@internationalized/date";
